<title>UK: London precious metals close up, PGMs dominate.</title>
<headline>London precious metals close up, PGMs dominate.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $348.40/$348.90 vs $347.80/$348.30 previously. PGMs, lower dollar providing support but faces resistance at $350.00. Sidelined by PGMs.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished at $4.85/$4.87, up a cent.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closed at $395.55/$396.55, up $6.55. Still tight and well bought. Very volatile.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended at $175.00/$176.00, up $5.00.</p>
</text>
